### New Travel — API externa (demo) + flujo app
@base_url = https://cacao.ilstechnik.com/api/v1
@user = biant_WS_DEMO
@password = F1maCsvj
@token = PEGAR_TOKEN_ACA
@language = spa

@appBaseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@appToken = PEGAR_JWT_ACA
@saleId = 1

### 1) Obtener token (copiar data.token a @token)
POST {{base_url}}/auth/get_token
Content-Type: application/json
Language: {{language}}

{
  "user": "{{user}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 2) Tipos de documento (API New Travel)
GET {{base_url}}/orders/type_documents
Token: {{token}}
Language: {{language}}

### 3) País AR (prefijo telefónico)
GET {{base_url}}/generals/country/AR
Token: {{token}}
Language: {{language}}

### 4) Lista de países
GET {{base_url}}/generals/countries
Token: {{token}}
Language: {{language}}

### 5) Reportar pago externo (demo — hoy falla 3951 en esta agencia)
# Reemplazar @orderCode por el voucherCode de una emisión waitForPayment
@orderCode = CCD-AIJHGB
POST {{base_url}}/payments/report
Token: {{token}}
Language: {{language}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "{{orderCode}}",
  "paymentCode": "DEMO-001",
  "details": "Pago de prueba demo"
}

### 6) Generar link de pago (sí funciona en demo)
POST {{base_url}}/payments/paymentLink
Token: {{token}}
Language: {{language}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "{{orderCode}}"
}

### 7) Consultar emisión / paid
GET {{base_url}}/orders/order/{{orderCode}}
Token: {{token}}
Language: {{language}}

### App — cotizar (incluye New Travel)
POST {{appBaseUrl}}/v1/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "departure_date": "2026-06-20",
  "return_date": "2026-06-27",
  "ages": [35],
  "origin": "AR",
  "destination_id": 3,
  "trip_type": "unico_viaje"
}

### App — catálogo documentos New Travel
GET {{appBaseUrl}}/v1/sales/new_travel/document-types
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
Accept: application/json

### App — países New Travel
GET {{appBaseUrl}}/v1/sales/new_travel/countries
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
Accept: application/json

### App — provincias New Travel (AR = Georef; otros = [])
GET {{appBaseUrl}}/v1/sales/new_travel/countries/AR/provinces
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
Accept: application/json

### App — abrir venta New Travel
POST {{appBaseUrl}}/v1/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "company": "new_travel",
  "quote_id": "2329",
  "quote": {
    "departure_date": "2026-06-20",
    "return_date": "2026-06-27",
    "ages": [35],
    "origin": "AR",
    "destination_id": 3,
    "trip_type": "unico_viaje",
    "amount": "120.50",
    "currency": "USD",
    "plan_name": "PLAN DEMO NTA",
    "markup": "0"
  }
}

### App — pasajeros (email/phone en todos)
POST {{appBaseUrl}}/v1/sales/{{saleId}}/passengers
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "receive_promotions": false,
  "emergency_contact": {
    "first_name": "Luis",
    "last_name": "Perez",
    "phone": "+5491100000001",
    "email": "luis.perez@example.com"
  },
  "passengers": [
    {
      "is_holder": true,
      "first_name": "Ana",
      "last_name": "Perez",
      "birth_date": "1991-04-22",
      "document_type": "passport",
      "document_number": "AAB123456",
      "gender": "f",
      "email": "ana.perez@example.com",
      "phone": "+5491100000000",
      "country_id": "AR",
      "province_id": "BA",
      "country": "Argentina",
      "province": "Buenos Aires",
      "street": "Av. Ejemplo",
      "street_number": "123",
      "city": "Buenos Aires"
    }
  ]
}

### App — abrir pago (checkout New Travel)
POST {{appBaseUrl}}/v1/sales/{{saleId}}/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "payment_method_id": "new_travel",
  "return_url_ok": "https://panel.example/ok",
  "return_url_error": "https://panel.example/error",
  "return_url_pending": "https://panel.example/pending"
}

### App — confirmar pago / voucher
POST {{appBaseUrl}}/v1/sales/{{saleId}}/payment/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
Accept: application/json

### App — detalle venta
GET {{appBaseUrl}}/v1/sales/{{saleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
Accept: application/json
